ts": [{"content": " \nWrite a report on NASA.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "One of my biggest goals is to become a  NASA Engineer. I want to design a spaceship that can be sent to Mars. Then, I'll be able to achieve my dream of exploring the red planet. "}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn8le15ob10re2vid02", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "Even the earliest civilizations performed methodical observations of the night sky. However, the invention of the telescope was required before the stars and planets could be seen and astronomy could be developed into a modern science. With their eyes on the heavens, men began to wonder whether the stars and planets they saw could be explored.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<p>The Earth's strong gravitational pull would have to be overcome before rockets could escape the stratosphere. If you do some research, you'll find out this didn't happen until the 20th century.</p>\nIf you Google the \"space race\", you can read how the US and the Soviet Union took turns sending satellites and men into orbit.  The ultimate goal though, was supposed to be a moon landing. The whole world waited to see who the race would be won by. If you have heard of Neil Armstrong, you may know that he was the first person to walk on the moon.", "time": "21000", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<p>Since that day, space exploration has gone even farther. If you log onto the NASA website, you will see pictures and data sent back by dozens of space probes. Even more information could be sent back by those still traveling. Still more probes are planned.</p>\nIf technology permits, there is no doubt that manned space exploration will one day take us to Jupiter, past the boundaries of our solar system, or even beyond.", "time": "55000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}